;
; Trampoline MBBs from splitting the cold critical edge of a diamond whose
; cold-arm PHI incoming is poison. PHI elimination materializes the poison as
; an IMPLICIT_DEF in the trampoline.
;
; @removable_trampoline: the cold arm passes the pointer unchanged, so the
; trampoline holds only the IMPLICIT_DEF and a coalescable copy. Once the
; IMPLICIT_DEF is hoisted into the predecessor, the trampoline is branch-only
; and folded away.
;
; @required_trampoline: the cold arm advances the pointer by 64; this real
; work must execute only on the cold edge, so the trampoline stays.
;
; @no_trampoline: no pointer PHI, no critical edge: the IMPLICIT_DEF lands in
; the entry block.
;
; RUN: llc -mtriple=aie2ps -stop-after=phi-node-elimination %s -o - \
; RUN:   | FileCheck %s

target triple = "aie2ps-none-unknown-elf"

